 in an hour.\",\"height\":0.014581679683766335,\"y\":0.5144880873159114,\"x\":0.08193278144877311,\"width\":0.31092435615007274},{\"text\":\"Introduction\",\"height\":0.011728050934447065,\"y\":0.48100450733922384,\"x\":0.07983193620064893,\"width\":0.107142852073492},{\"text\":\"Silvermine Bay is on the NE of Lantao\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.4578235671008458,\"x\":0.12605043466825497,\"width\":0.329831912018532},{\"text\":\"The whole area was affected by\",\"height\":0.01322178370862026,\"y\":0.4433139535273277,\"x\":0.16386554578881524,\"width\":0.29201680028161336},{\"text\":\"submergence once, but now, the alluvium\",\"height\":0.014556409463679754,\"y\":0.428779070040051,\"x\":0.08193278231622211,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"brought down by the streams has filled\",\"height\":0.013081395234588844,\"y\":0.4171511629326087,\"x\":0.08403361594772166,\"width\":0.3718487406885901},{\"text\":\"up the area, forming\",\"height\":0.013081395234588733,\"y\":0.40261627896337426,\"x\":0.08403361538422777,\"width\":0.1974789925508721},{\"text\":\"an infilled valley.\",\"height\":0.013081395234588844,\"y\":0.40261627905421726,\"x\":0.2836134423527097,\"width\":0.174369748137718},{\"text\":\"Rock type of the area varies from place to\",\"height\":0.01323395057869814,\"y\":0.38953488385072876,\"x\":0.08403362421047976,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"place, but granite and granite porphyry are\",\"height\":0.016097875080489432,\"y\":0.3734707020843614,\"x\":0.08193277852420547,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"the main constituents.\",\"height\":0.013081395234588844,\"y\":0.3633720930949149,\"x\":0.08193277586273383,\"width\":0.20378151117369186},{\"text\":\"The latter often\",\"height\":0.01030264035855577,\"y\":0.3647778491908378,\"x\":0.30672268941779934,\"width\":0.14915965945221654},{\"text\":\"appears in the form of dykes. Syenite （an\",\"height\":0.013238630522011352,\"y\":0.34867997414470164,\"x\":0.08403361656746959,\"width\":0.3718487406885901},{\"text\":\"igneous rock without quartz） can be found\",\"height\":0.01609881094633503,\"y\":0.3341918864670971,\"x\":0.0798319305908155,\"width\":0.37605042923328486},{\"text\":\"just south of the sandspit, west of the pier.\",\"height\":0.016097875080489432,\"y\":0.3197037990416486,\"x\":0.07983193715101765,\"width\":0.37815125931140986},{\"text\":\"General Description\",\"height\":0.016146542560800947,\"y\":0.2848837213274835,\"x\":0.08193277516958629,\"width\":0.174369748137718},{\"text\":\"The beach of Silvermine Bay is mark-\",\"height\":0.014602269960539704,\"y\":0.2645348841631131,\"x\":0.1260504245613706,\"width\":0.3319327704851017},{\"text\":\"ed by a sandspit, nearly linked up\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.25144880851012885,\"x\":0.08403362542636408,\"width\":0.31092435615007263},{\"text\":\"at the\",\"height\":0.010174418447559619,\"y\":0.25290697675005736,\"x\":0.3928571410858534,\"width\":0.06512605179187864},{\"text\":\"free end with the coast.\",\"height\":0.013738424641350666,\"y\":0.23830288710959013,\"x\":0.08178629602237876,\"width\":0.2104359187636265},{\"text\":\"It is caused by a\",\"height\":0.0167724955719053,\"y\":0.23618344520067225,\"x\":0.3082922494510997,\"width\":0.14808531295421512},{\"text\":\"longshore drift from the north. Here, the\",\"height\":0.014576999740453234,\"y\":0.2223837212270665,\"x\":0.08193278903836403,\"width\":0.3760504008448401},{\"text\":\"fetch is over 20 miles and so the drift is\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.21216999360445443,\"x\":0.08193278653136139,\"width\":0.37605040084484015},{\"text\":\"quite a strong one.\",\"height\":0.013207745106851188,\"y\":0.19767441868600022,\"x\":0.08403362009844624,\"width\":0.17016805959302328},{\"text\":\"The materials making\",\"height\":0.016114721279795186,\"y\":0.19476744204332663,\"x\":0.26260504541956114,\"width\":0.19537814827852473},{\"text\":\"up the spit may be partly brought down by\",\"height\":0.01609787508048932,\"y\":0.18158403088215025,\"x\":0.08193277549899544,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"the streams and partly derived from the\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.16999356113992614,\"x\":0.08193277650335044,\"width\":0.3760504008448401},{\"text\":\"weathering and erosion of the coast near-by.\",\"height\":0.013081395234588844,\"y\":0.15697674426133934,\"x\":0.08403362265235659,\"width\":0.37394957076671514},{\"text\":\"The sandspit encloses a lagoon on its\",\"height\":0.013219911976929177,\"y\":0.14389534895489542,\"x\":0.12605042424624455,\"width\":0.3319327704851017},{\"text\":\"west which is wide and shallow.\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.13071474560684293,\"x\":0.08403362681193653,\"width\":0.27731090456940405},{\"text\":\"There are\",\"height\":0.010174418447559619,\"y\":0.132267441884505,\"x\":0.37394957812547713,\"width\":0.08403361475744914},{\"text\":\"lots of mangrove swamps and mudfats.\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.1162266582849556,\"x\":0.08193278747148736,\"width\":0.3760504008448401},{\"text\":\"The lagoon provides a haven for the fishing\",\"height\":0.014540499130219486,\"y\":0.10173857025560151,\"x\":0.0840336225998356,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"junks.\",\"height\":0.013310872733170775,\"y\":0.09000154015697803,\"x\":0.08187352630889692,\"width\":0.05263950081758721},{\"text\":\"（B）\",\"height\":0.00877521365055789,\"y\":0.6744186046265387,\"x\":0.49579831956771103,\"width\":0.025210083362668056},{\"text\":\"The lagoon is surrounded by alluvium，\",\"height\":0.014610693367235306,\"y\":0.6119186046088494,\"x\":0.5420168105557683,\"width\":0.33193277048510184},{\"text\":\"which is very fertile.\",\"height\":0.014534883321060788,\"y\":0.598837209429586,\"x\":0.4957983161484735,\"width\":0.18277311103288518},{\"text\":\"Farming is practised\",\"height\":0.013081395234588955,\"y\":0.6002906978163296,\"x\":0.6953781577408179,\"width\":0.176470578215843},{\"text\":\"all over the area.\",\"height\":0.011631650611499178,\"y\":0.5872093022398951,\"x\":0.49789916565435854,\"width\":0.15546217807503637},{\"text\":\"It is quite flat and the\",\"height\":0.013241438119548143,\"y\":0.587209302546223,\"x\":0.6701680679673949,\"width\":0.20168066690134456},{\"text\":\"gqradient very gentle. The streams here\",\"height\":0.013081395234588733,\"y\":0.5726744185406514,\"x\":0.49789915796398165,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"are\",\"height\":0.008761174741746203,\"y\":0.5624597553449333,\"x\":0.4978991618104056,\"width\":0.042016803830169036},{\"text\":\"rather\",\"height\":0.008761174741746203,\"y\":0.5624597552964837,\"x\":0.5399159690368553,\"width\":0.05882352607194763},{\"text\":\"small in\",\"height\":0.01298028242181215,\"y\":0.5603703237859134,\"x\":0.6090797705299456,\"width\":0.09486566587936052},{\"text\":\"Size because\",\"height\":0.010174418447559619,\"y\":0.5610465115368792,\"x\":0.7058823515044444,\"width\":0.12184874068859008},{\"text\":\"the\",\"height\":0.010174418447559619,\"y\":0.5610465115368792,\"x\":0.8424369760450383,\"width\":0.029411763035973815},{\"text\":\"water has been drawn away for irrigation\",\"height\":0.013231142981161348,\"y\":0.5463618802720343,\"x\":0.497899168870844,\"width\":0.37394957076671514},{\"text\":\"purposes.\",\"height\":0.011730858531983968,\"y\":0.5318737928133923,\"x\":0.4978991623414826,\"width\":0.08193277048510178},{\"text\":\"There are lots of boulders on\",\"height\":0.011643818095662284,\"y\":0.5334302322786547,\"x\":0.6008403489384724,\"width\":0.2710083859465844},{\"text\":\"the stream beds. Some small meanders also\",\"height\":0.011681254571741406,\"y\":0.5218023256410579,\"x\":0.4978991633561383,\"width\":0.37394957076671514},{\"text\":\"show river cliffs and slip-off slopes.\",\"height\":0.016097875080489432,\"y\":0.5028976172184736,\"x\":0.49579833128477213,\"width\":0.31722687477289246},{\"text\":\"Now\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.5057952350440187,\"x\":0.8298319328652595,\"width\":0.0420168073787246},{\"text\":\"the area has been gradually uplifted. The\",\"height\":0.01321897611108358,\"y\":0.4925949772474899,\"x\":0.49789916045697863,\"width\":0.37394957076671514},{\"text\":\"fields in the area are mostly planted with\",\"height\":0.015092450576064897,\"y\":0.47767385993986966,\"x\":0.4998982488470977,\"width\":0.37203587731649707},{\"text\":\"vegetables and rice.\",\"height\":0.013081395234588844,\"y\":0.4651162791087231,\"x\":0.5000000072156079,\"width\":0.176470578215843},{\"text\":\"Market-gardening is\",\"height\":0.014578872086229544,\"y\":0.4636188020961032,\"x\":0.6953781540643473,\"width\":0.1764705782158431},{\"text\":\"practised mostly because\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.45202833217572436,\"x\":0.5000000067350177,\"width\":0.23949579283248545},{\"text\":\"there is．easy\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.4520283320303756,\"x\":0.7373949595346052,\"width\":0.13235293366188228},{\"text\":\"transport to the market by ferry.\",\"height\":0.014534883321060788,\"y\":0.43750000019993474,\"x\":0.49789916388516503,\"width\":0.29621848882630814},{\"text\":\"Besides\",\"height\":0.011912427559562122,\"y\":0.4388280748577379,\"x\":0.8067226875756994,\"width\":0.06512605179187858},{\"text\":\"rice\",\"height\":0.010302639744470654,\"y\":0.4272376049191906,\"x\":0.5000000010350331,\"width\":0.03151260375976572},{\"text\":\"and vegetables, orchards\",\"height\":0.014575128008761928,\"y\":0.4229651166243533,\"x\":0.5462184954278094,\"width\":0.24579831145530529},{\"text\":\"are\",\"height\":0.007405022537025019,\"y\":0.42723760452455806,\"x\":0.7920168072035607,\"width\":0.04621848527775263},{\"text\":\"also\",\"height\":0.011668151835818041,\"y\":0.4258720929739067,\"x\":0.8361344543138413,\"width\":0.037815125931141},{\"text\":\"found.\",\"height\":0.011669087701663639,\"y\":0.4127495170351855,\"x\":0.4978991604623585,\"width\":0.056722688896711504},{\"text\":\"The NW limit of the infilled valley is\",\"height\":0.01609787508048932,\"y\":0.38216355441208705,\"x\":0.5399159761679665,\"width\":0.33403360056322673},{\"text\":\"marked by the lst waterfall which is about\",\"height\":0.017493135608248167,\"y\":0.3697359756738451,\"x\":0.49978911436463447,\"width\":0.37428446924963665},{\"text\":\"30 feet high. It is often called a knick-point\",\"height\":0.01455453773198856,\"y\":0.35608499702447205,\"x\":0.4978991740261092,\"width\":0.37605040084484015},{\"text\":\"and is formed by a more resistant granite\",\"height\":0.01612501641818187,\"y\":0.34156976773009995,\"x\":0.49579831519723644,\"width\":0.37815125931140986},{\"text\":\"porphyry dyke running from ENE to WSW.\",\"height\":0.013081395234588733,\"y\":0.3299418605404091,\"x\":0.497899168870844,\"width\":0.37394957076671514},{\"text\":\"The dyke is well jointed, and is severely\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.31680618182337095,\"x\":0.5000000053875893,\"width\":0.3697478822220204},{\"text\":\"affected by block disintegration. It inclines\",\"height\":0.014636898839082257,\"y\":0.3037790702096246,\"x\":0.5000000062833091,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"slightly seawards.\",\"height\":0.014810045074050149,\"y\":0.28911783641052125,\"x\":0.4978991611229075,\"width\":0.15966386661973114},{\"text\":\"A silvermine is found\",\"height\":0.011912427559562233,\"y\":0.2920154541161534,\"x\":0.6764705877725025,\"width\":0.19537814827852462},{\"text\":\"just close to the south-west of the waterfall.\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.27752736656281707,\"x\":0.49789916312800037,\"width\":0.37605040084484004},{\"text\":\"It is from this mine that the name ‘Silver-\",\"height\":0.011679382840050323,\"y\":0.26593689650920194,\"x\":0.49789916312800037,\"width\":0.37605040084484004},{\"text\":\"sulphide）\",\"height\":0.01513974987454969,\"y\":0.2351626833472813,\"x\":0.49568552116694337,\"width\":0.08005752918332126},{\"text\":\"is found outcropping\",\"height\":0.01664518956898564,\"y\":0.235012224139453,\"x\":0.5900139820077865,\"width\":0.21702059013898978},{\"text\":\"entrance. Now the mine is abandoned and\",\"height\":0.01854288969512763,\"y\":0.2216422454207223,\"x\":0.49976992130964604,\"width\":0.3743579953215843},{\"text\":\"blocked by a concrete wall.\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.2092723761073737,\"x\":0.5000000057371186,\"width\":0.23949579283248545},{\"text\":\"To the NW of the Ist waterfall, along\",\"height\":0.014636898839082257,\"y\":0.18158403101185527,\"x\":0.5420168108708945,\"width\":0.3319327704851017},{\"text\":\"the stream, is a broad open valley with\",\"height\":0.014599462363003024,\"y\":0.1699935609351243,\"x\":0.5000000020116006,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"paddy\",\"height\":0.008748071698780113,\"y\":0.1584030908975892,\"x\":0.5000000003995789,\"width\":0.06512605179187858},{\"text\":\"and\",\"height\":0.010302640051513157,\"y\":0.15840309087082616,\"x\":0.5651260498495556,\"width\":0.037815125931141},{\"text\":\"vegetables.\",\"height\":0.014752064377587581,\"y\":0.15396117693290945,\"x\":0.6218148662400879,\"width\":0.09670640102652606},{\"text\":\"Pineapples\",\"height\":0.015375188912258309,\"y\":0.15364961491274653,\"x\":0.7351599001205877,\"width\":0.09270541168922597},{\"text\":\"are\",\"height\":0.00740502253702513,\"y\":0.15840309094069738,\"x\":0.8424369749058315,\"width\":0.03151260375976561},{\"text\":\"found on the slopes. On the western bank\",\"height\":0.01162790714811679,\"y\":0.14389534883873223,\"x\":0.5000000031220914,\"width\":0.3718487406885902},{\"text\":\"of the stream, low river terraces can be\",\"height\":0.013081395234588733,\"y\":0.12936046539142654,\"x\":0.49999999865025613,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"seen. These terraces are left standing there\",\"height\":0.013081395234588844,\"y\":0.11482558152514732,\"x\":0.5000000082721046,\"width\":0.3739495707667151},{\"text\":\"because of the rapid down cutting of the\",\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"y\":0.1017385703671515,\"x\":0.50000000827210